# Table 1 基线表：待审阅规格

适用范围：研究中已确认的全部合格成人；本规格不改变分析人群。正式表题为 Table 1. Baseline characteristics。

首列为 Characteristic；两组列严格按 Treatment A、Treatment B 排列，各列标题写该组全体人数 N。行严格依次为 Age (years)、Female sex、BMI (kg/m²)。年龄和 BMI 显示 mean (SD)，均值与 SD 保留 1 位小数；本候选采用样本标准差。Female sex 显示 n (%)，计数为整数、百分比保留 1 位小数。

每个变量分别排除该变量的缺失值，使用该变量的非缺失人数作为汇总分母；Female sex 的百分比分母为该组性别非缺失人数。标题 N 始终为该组全体人数。脚注按变量和组报告缺失人数，并解释 mean (SD)、n (%)、SD 和 BMI。保持紧凑，不加入显著性检验或 P 值。

下方数值完全模拟，仅用于审阅版式及分母规则，不能用于投稿或作为研究发现。正式表中需以核验后的研究数据替换 N、数值与缺失人数，移除模拟说明；在确认规格、确定实际变量映射并核验数据前，不生成或注册正式 Results。若实际数据出现零个或单个非缺失观测，先核实可计算性并补充呈现约定，不能虚构值。目标期刊尚未提供，投稿格式合规性未核验。

```table
{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "id": "baseline-table-simulated",
  "title": "Table 1. Baseline characteristics — SIMULATED REVIEW EXAMPLE",
  "simulated": true,
  "columns": [
    {
      "id": "a",
      "label": "Treatment A (N = 4)",
      "align": "right"
    },
    {
      "id": "b",
      "label": "Treatment B (N = 5)",
      "align": "right"
    }
  ],
  "headers": [
    {
      "id": "ha",
      "label": "Treatment A (N = 4)",
      "column_id": "a"
    },
    {
      "id": "hb",
      "label": "Treatment B (N = 5)",
      "column_id": "b"
    }
  ],
  "rows": [
    {
      "id": "age",
      "label": "Age (years)",
      "cells": {
        "a": "50.0 (10.0)",
        "b": "50.0 (15.8)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "female",
      "label": "Female sex",
      "cells": {
        "a": "2 (66.7)",
        "b": "2 (50.0)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bmi",
      "label": "BMI (kg/m²)",
      "cells": {
        "a": "24.0 (4.0)",
        "b": "25.0 (2.6)"
      }
    }
  ],
  "footnotes": [
    {
      "id": "simulated",
      "text": "SIMULATED EXAMPLE ONLY. Invented values for Council presentation review; no study findings or manuscript-ready results."
    },
    {
      "id": "format",
      "text": "Age and BMI: mean (SD), both to one decimal; Female sex: n (%), percentage to one decimal. SD denotes sample standard deviation; BMI denotes body mass index."
    },
    {
      "id": "denominator",
      "text": "N in each heading is the full group size. Missing values are excluded separately for each variable's summary and denominator; female percentages use nonmissing sex values. No significance tests."
    },
    {
      "id": "missing",
      "text": "Missing counts, Treatment A / Treatment B: Age 1 / 0; Female sex 1 / 1; BMI 1 / 1."
    }
  ]
}
```

